# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Profiler output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nsight Systems writes .nsys-rep plus a .qdstrm staging file and exports a
# multi-GB .sqlite per capture; Nsight Compute and Nsight Graphics have their
# own formats. All of it is machine-local and far too large to track.
*.qdstrm
*.qdrep
*.ncu-rep
*.nvvp
*.nsight-gfxr
*.gfxr
# VTune result directories when collected in place (r000hs, r001gpu, ...) and
# the per-run files inside them.
r0[0-9][0-9]*/
*.vtune
*.dataLim

